      <p class="hero-summary">Reem Glasco, LPC-S, is a Licensed Professional Counselor Supervisor in
        Austin, Texas, and has held Texas supervisor status since 2009. She is an EMDRIA
        Approved Consultant, a NARM therapist and a Somatic Experiencing Practitioner. She sees
        adults and young adults for developmental trauma, C-PTSD, anxiety, panic and
        depression, and supervises LPC Associates across the state.</p>
      <p class="hero-summary">The clinical center is IFS-informed EMDR: processing that consults
        a person's protective parts instead of overriding them, with Somatic Experiencing
        setting the pace. Supervision and consultation run online statewide, and some of the work happens on a
        trail or with horses.</p>
      <p><a href="/about/">See her background and credentials</a></p>
    </div>
